    "title": "EWC Rodeo Team Competes at Casper College Ropin' and Riggin' Days - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago CASPER, Wyo. - The Eastern Wyoming College rodeo team competed April 17-19 at the Casper College Ropin' and Riggin' Days held at the Central Wyoming Fairgrounds in Casper. In saddle bronc riding, EWC sophomore Sawyer Hutchinson turned in a strong performance, placing sixth in the long round with a 69-point ride. He followed with a 71-point ride in the short round, finishing fourth in the round and fourth in the average. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
